Package: scramble
Type: Package
Title: Cellwise Robust and Sparse Principal Component Analysis
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R:
    person("Pia", "Pfeiffer", , "pia.pfeiffer@tuwien.ac.at", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Sparse and cellwise robust principal component analysis based on
    manifold optimization. Loadings are estimated by Riemannian gradient descent
    on the Stiefel manifold with an elastic net penalty and robust loss functions
    (Huber, Tukey, least trimmed squares), using 'torch' for automatic
    differentiation. Robust starting values are obtained from rank-based or
    wrapping transformations, and penalty parameters are tuned by Bayesian
    optimization. For details see Pfeiffer, Vana-Gür and Filzmoser (2025)
    <doi:10.1007/s11634-025-00656-3>.
URL: https://github.com/piapfeiffer/scramble
BugReports: https://github.com/piapfeiffer/scramble/issues
